translate japanese strings:
    old "It is a relief that it worked out.{#ch5_10_v15995}"
    new "成功して良かった。本当に良かった。"

    old "That was completely reckless! Almost all the main actors were amateurs!{#ch5_10_v11702}"
    new "無茶苦茶だって！メインの役者のほとんどが素人なんて！"

    old "Oh, do not say that. The audience would get bored if every performance were the same.{#ch5_10_v15996}"
    new "まぁ、そう言わない。お客もいつも同じ演技じゃ、飽きちゃうしね。"

    old "So it is over… Looking back, those were happy days.{#ch5_10_v579}"
    new "終わってしまったのですね……。思い出してみれば楽しい日々でした。"

    old "Here is the bag I promised you.{#ch5_10_v15997}"
    new "はい、これ約束のバッグ。"

    old "Oh, thank you very much!{#ch5_10_v2378}"
    new "あ、ありがとうございます！"

    old "Hiraga, look! My purse was in this hidden pocket!{#ch5_10_v2379}"
    new "平賀くん見て！この隠しポケットに私のお財布が入ってた！"

    old "I see. It certainly is Haruna's. I am sorry for all the things I said.{#ch5_10_v15998}"
    new "なるほど、確かにハルナのものだね。いろいろ言って悪かったよ。"

    old "No, it is all right… It came back to me like this, after all.{#ch5_10_v2380}"
    new "いえ、いいんです……。こうして戻ってきたんですから。"

    old "That is great, Haruna!{#ch5_10_v11703}"
    new "良かったな、春奈！"

    old "Well, I suppose that is good.{#ch5_10_v6258}"
    new "まぁ、良かったんじゃない？"

    old "Y-yes! Thank you, everyone.{#ch5_10_v2381}"
    new "う、うん！ありがとう、みなさん。"

    old "…Phew. I still feel like I have not come down from the excitement.{#ch5_10_v11704}"
    new "……はあ。なんだかまだ興奮がさめない気がするな。"

    old "Oh, Saito. You came at just the right time…{#ch5_10_v4732}"
    new "あら、サイト。ちょうど良かった……。"

    old "L-Louise, what is that dress…?{#ch5_10_v8631}"
    new "ル、ルイズ、そのドレスは……？"

    old "Heehee. Since today's performance is the last one, they lent it to me.{#ch5_10_v4733}"
    new "うふふ、舞台公演も今日でおしまいだから貸してもらったの。"

    old "So, let us have dinner. They had the food prepared, too.{#ch5_10_v4734}"
    new "というわけで、ディナーをしましょう。料理も用意してもらったんだから。"

    old "Yeah…{#ch5_10_v8632}"
    new "ああ……。"

    old "You are so tactless. Escort me properly, will you?{#ch5_10_v4735}"
    new "もう、気が利かないわね。ちゃんとエスコートしてよ？"

    old "S-sorry.{#ch5_10_v8633}"
    new "ご、ごめん。"

    old "I thought you might be a little cool in the play, so why are you like this in real life?{#ch5_10_v4736}"
    new "演劇の中では、少しはかっこいいかもって思ったのに、どうして、現実だとこうなのかしら？"

    old "I-I do not know what to say to that…{#ch5_10_v8634}"
    new "い、いや、そう言われても……。"

    old "What an amazing meal. It must have cost a fortune, did it not?{#ch5_10_v8635}"
    new "すごい料理だな。ずいぶん、お金がかかったんじゃないのか？"

    old "Really? But Weatherly paid me for appearing, so it was not that expensive.{#ch5_10_v4737}"
    new "そう？でも、ウェザリーから出演料貰ったし、それほどでもないわよ。"

    old "Saito?{#ch5_10_v4738}"
    new "サイト？"

    old "Hm?{#ch5_10_v8636}"
    new "ん？"

    old "How do I look to you right now, Saito?{#ch5_10_v4739}"
    new "サイトから見て、今のわたしってどう見える？"

    old "H-how should I know what to say…{#ch5_10_v8637}"
    new "ど、どうって言われても……。"

    old "Oh, Saito-san. You came at just the right time…{#ch5_10_v14263}"
    new "あ、サイトさん。ちょうど良かった……。"

    old "Huh? Siesta, is something wrong?{#ch5_10_v8647}"
    new "あれ？シエスタ、どうかしたの？"

    old "I received my pay for the play today, so I asked Haruna-san and tried to make food from your country.{#ch5_10_v14264}"
    new "今日はお芝居のお給金をいただきましたので、ハルナさんに伺ってサイトさんの国の料理を作ってみたんです。"

    old "What? Seriously…{#ch5_10_v8648}"
    new "えっ？マジ……。"

    old "There were many ingredients I could not find or did not understand… Will you try it?{#ch5_10_v14265}"
    new "よく分からなかったり、手に入らない材料も多かったのですけど……。食べていただけますか？"

    old "You bet!{#ch5_10_v8649}"
    new "そりゃ、もう！"

    old "Whoa, what is this!{#ch5_10_v8650}"
    new "おおっ、これは！"

    old "Grilled fish and… lightly pickled vegetables…{#ch5_10_v8651}"
    new "焼き魚に……浅漬け……。"

    old "I could not get something called miso, so I used osumashi instead…{#ch5_10_v14266}"
    new "オミソというのが手に入らなかったので、オスマシというのにしたんですけど……。"

    old "But I made something called udon as well, so please eat it.{#ch5_10_v14267}"
    new "あ、そのかわりにオウドンというのを作ったので食べてください。"

    old "Whoa!{#ch5_10_v8652}"
    new "おおっ！"

    old "Haruna-san lamented that, apart from the grilled fish, all she needed was dashi and soy sauce.{#ch5_10_v14268}"
    new "ハルナさんは、焼魚以外はオダシとショーユがあればと随分嘆いていましたけど。"

    old "This is plenty! Ah, udon… I have not had this in ages.{#ch5_10_v8653}"
    new "充分だって！ああ、うどんなんて懐かしいなぁ。"

    old "And in your country, everyone eats with these two sticks, right?{#ch5_10_v14269}"
    new "それから、サイトさんの国では、みんなこの２本の棒を使って食べるんですよね？"

    old "I heard your great-grandfather did that too.{#ch5_10_v14270}"
    new "ひいおじいちゃんもそうだったって聞いてますけど。"

    old "Wow, even chopsticks! Siesta, you really thought of everything! All right, let us eat!{#ch5_10_v8654}"
    new "おおー！　お箸まで！さすがシエスタ、気がきいてる！それじゃ、いただきま～～す！"

    old "But food from your country is strange, is it not?{#ch5_10_v14271}"
    new "……でも、サイトさんの国の料理って不思議ですよね。"

    old "Hm? Is it?{#ch5_10_v8655}"
    new "ん？そうかな？"

    old "I cannot tell whether it is simple or elaborate… Haruna-san said you care about the original taste of the ingredients.{#ch5_10_v14272}"
    new "単純なのか凝ってるのか……。ハルナさんは、素材本来の味にこだわるって言ってました。"

    old "…Huh.{#ch5_10_v8656}"
    new "……へぇ。"

    old "Come to think of it, there was a funny story in the village about your great-grandfather eating raw eggs…{#ch5_10_v14273}"
    new "そういえば、ひいおじいちゃんが生の卵を食べたという笑い話が村にあったんですが……。"

    old "When I asked Haruna-san, she said that was normal in your country. I was surprised.{#ch5_10_v14274}"
    new "ハルナさんに聞いたら、サイトさんの国では普通だって言われてびっくりしましたよ。"

    old "Your great-grandfather must have had a hard time too, Siesta.{#ch5_10_v8657}"
    new "シエスタのひいおじいちゃんも苦労したんだろうな。"

    old "Ah, my beloved. How deeply I loved you.{#ch5_10_v2795}"
    new "ああ、愛しい人よ。僕がどれほど君を愛したことか。"

    old "Love blinds everyone and drives them mad. The noblemen who whispered love to you all met ruin trying to answer your riddles.{#ch5_10_v2796}"
    new "愛は誰をも盲目にし狂わせる。君に愛を囁いた貴公子達は、君の謎かけに答えようとして、みな破滅していった。"

    old "But I will no longer laugh at their foolishness. I wagered this kingdom for you, and destroyed it myself!{#ch5_10_v2797}"
    new "だが、僕はもうその愚を笑うことはすまい。僕自身も君のためにこの王国を賭け、そして滅ぼしたからだ！"

    old "Men are such fools.{#ch5_10_v2798}"
    new "バカよね。男達って。"

    old "Kirche. I wondered where you were…{#ch5_10_v8694}"
    new "キュルケ。こんなところにいたのか……。"

    old "…Oh, darling?{#ch5_10_v2799}"
    new "……あら、ダーリン？"

    old "What is wrong?{#ch5_10_v8695}"
    new "どうしたんだ？"

    old "Nothing. I just became a little sentimental.{#ch5_10_v2800}"
    new "ううん、ちょっと感傷的になっちゃっただけ。"

    old "The days onstage, with all that festival excitement, are finally over.{#ch5_10_v2801}"
    new "お祭り騒ぎだった舞台での毎日も、とうとう終わっちゃったな、って。"

    old "Yeah.{#ch5_10_v8696}"
    new "そうだな。"

    old "I had never been surrounded by so many people, so I got nervous.{#ch5_10_v2802}"
    new "あんなに人に囲まれたことがなかったから、緊張しちゃった。"

    old "Really?{#ch5_10_v8697}"
    new "え、そうなの？"

    old "Yes. Besides, the atmosphere onstage is quite unique, is it not?{#ch5_10_v2803}"
    new "そうよ。それに舞台の空気って独特じゃない？"

    old "Yeah, it certainly is…{#ch5_10_v8698}"
    new "ああ、確かに……。"

    old "Hey, darling. Shall we perform the climax again?{#ch5_10_v2804}"
    new "ねぇ、ダーリン。もう一度クライマックスの演技をしてみない？"

    old "On a stage with only the two of us…{#ch5_10_v2805}"
    new "２人きりの舞台で……。"

    old "Sure, why not.{#ch5_10_v8699}"
    new "ああ、いいぜ。"

    old "My beloved. But I shall not regret it.{#ch5_10_v8700}"
    new "愛しい人。だが、後悔はすまい。"

    old "My love for you was worth that price. If only… just once…{#ch5_10_v8701}"
    new "君への愛にはそれだけの価値があった。ただ、願わくば……ただ一度……。"

    old "I wanted to know what you truly felt.{#ch5_10_v8702}"
    new "君の本当の気持ちを知りたかった。"

    old "Hey? Do you really want to know? Do you want to know how I feel?{#ch5_10_v2806}"
    new "ねぇ？本当に知りたい？わたしの気持ちを知りたい？"

    old "W-wait a minute. That is not Kirche's next line, is it?{#ch5_10_v8703}"
    new "ちょ、ちょっと待てよ。次の台詞はキュルケじゃないだろ？"

    old "Do not dodge the question. Answer yes or no.{#ch5_10_v2807}"
    new "ごまかさないで。はい、か、いいえ、どちらかで答えて。"
